15 0 obj
<< /A 35 0 R /Alt (Illustration of brain regions with bar charts showcasing functional connectivity \(FC\) differences across groups: CID-nD \(red\), CID-D \(blue\), and GSC \(yellow\). Significant differences are marked with asterisks, with p-values: one asterisk for less than 0.05, two for less than 0.01, and three for less than 0.001. Brain areas include ITG.L, SMA.R, POCG.R, SFGmed.R, and IFGtri.L. Color scale indicates F value range from negative ten to 9.0038.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 36 0 R /Alt (Three scatter plots labeled A, B, and C show different correlations. A and B indicate positive correlations between FC of sgACC-left ITG and sgACC-left IFGtri with SDS scores \(r=0.242, p=0.006 and r=0.326, p<0.001, respectively\). Plot C shows a negative correlation between FC of sgACC-right POCG and SDS scores \(r=-0.211, p=0.016\). Each plot includes a trend line with shaded confidence intervals.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
